ue":"Medicaid expansion","why":"Johnson notes South Carolina is one of 10 states that have not expanded Medicaid, while Wilson warns it could strain the budget.","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/"},{"issue":"Data centers","why":"Johnson backs a moratorium with community veto power, while Wilson prefers guardrails requiring data centers to generate their own power.","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/"},{"issue":"Gambling","why":"Both support regulated online sports betting, but Johnson would also allow casinos if voters approve and Wilson opposes them.","src":"https://www.herecolumbia.com/2026/10/20/sc-governor-race-wilson-johnson-final-two-weeks-early-voting/"},{"issue":"License plate cameras","why":"Johnson wants a statewide ban on Flock cameras over privacy, while Wilson calls them a valuable police tool.","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Wilson's closing ad on income tax","date":"2026-10-22","what":"Wilson launched his final statewide ad featuring his teenage children complaining about state income tax, promoting his plan to eliminate it.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.fitsnews.com/2026/10/22/alan-wilsons-closing-ad-touts-income-tax-elimination-plan/"},{"title":"Poll shows Wilson up double digits","date":"2026-10-20","what":"An NPA poll of likely voters had Wilson at 51 percent and Johnson at 41, though undecided voters were splitting nearly evenly.","helps":"R","kind":"local","src":"https://www.fitsnews.com/2026/10/20/crossroads-2026-alan-wilson-retains-double-digit-lead-in-s-c-governors-race/"},{"title":"Early voting opens","date":"2026-10-19","what":"Wilson campaigned in the Upstate while Johnson voted in Columbia and headed to the Grand Strand, criticizing corruption and backroom deals.","helps":"mixed","kind":"local","src":"https://www.live5news.com/2026/10/19/south-carolina-governors-race-enters-two-week-sprint/"},{"title":"Wilson's fundraising edge","date":"2026-10-19","what":"Wilson reported raising more than 2.5 million dollars last quarter compared with about 700,000 for Johnson.","helps":"R","kind":"local","src":"https://www.live5news.com/2026/10/19/south-carolina-governors-race-enters-two-week-sprint/"},{"title":"Debate clash on crime and Medicaid","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Wilson said he knows more about fighting fentanyl than Johnson will learn, and Johnson answered that Wilson has spent his career in statewide office while he worked on the ground.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/"},{"title":"Johnson pitches Medicaid expansion","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Johnson called Medicaid expansion good economic policy, while Wilson pointed to North Carolina and warned of long term costs.","helps":"D","kind":"policy","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/"}],"events":[{"title":"Eliminating the income tax","prompt":"One campaign promises to eliminate the state income tax without new tax hikes. Voters ask what it would mean for schools and roads.","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.fitsnews.com/2026/10/22/alan-wilsons-closing-ad-touts-income-tax-elimination-plan/","opts":[{"label":"Protect services","say":"Oppose elimination and argue it would starve schools and shift costs to working families.","pos":-0.7,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Targeted relief","say":"Cut taxes for working families and lower utility bills without ending the income tax.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Go to zero","say":"Phase out the income tax entirely and let growth fill the gap.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.4,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Medicaid expansion","prompt":"South Carolina is one of 10 states that has not expanded Medicaid. Rural hospitals want an answer.","issue":"health","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/","opts":[{"label":"Expand now","say":"Expand Medicaid as good economic policy and bring federal dollars home.","pos":-0.8,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Study a waiver","say":"Explore a limited waiver with work rules and cost controls.","pos":0.2,"trump":0.1,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Oppose expansion","say":"Reject expansion over long term costs that could crowd out teacher and police raises.","pos":0.8,"trump":0.5,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Data center moratorium","prompt":"Communities are pushing back on data centers over power bills and land use. You must decide whether to pause them.","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/07/watch-wilson-johnson-debate-race-sc-governor/","opts":[{"label":"Moratorium","say":"Pause new projects and give communities the final say.","pos":-0.6,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Guardrails","say":"Require data centers to generate their own power under state standards.","pos":0.3,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Recruit them","say":"Keep recruiting data centers for jobs and investment with minimal new rules.","pos":0.8,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Casinos on the ballot","prompt":"Lawmakers have stalled on gambling while neighboring states take the revenue. You are asked about sports betting and casinos.","issue":"other","src":"https://www.herecolumbia.com/2026/10/20/sc-governor-race-wilson-johnson-final-two-weeks-early-voting/","opts":[{"label":"Betting and casinos","say":"Back online betting and let voters approve casinos.","pos":-0.5,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Online betting only","say":"Support regulated online sports betting but oppose casinos.","pos":0.3,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"No gambling","say":"Oppose any expansion of gambling in South Carolina.","pos":0.9,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"}]}],"debates":[{"date":"2026-10-06","where":"Columbia","src":"https://abcnews4.com/news/state/rep-johnson-ag-wilson-set-to-deba